      "lessons": [
        "Modular DRL algorithm abstraction enables pluggable trading strategies (A2C, DDPG, PPO, SAC, TD3) without core framework changes",
        "Multi-source data integration with fallback logic (Yahoo Finance \u2192 FMP \u2192 WRDS) demonstrates resilience-first design for financial data pipelines",
        "Educational-first approach with Jupyter notebooks as primary artifact (2.8MB) suggests learning and reproducibility are core design values",
        "Clear ecosystem stratification (FinRL-Meta for envs, ElegantRL for algorithms, FinRL-Trading for production) shows intentional separation of concerns across complexity tiers"
